=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Felmsy} at the Wharf to Yahse waypoint to start the quest.
* Trade a {i:Velkk Mask|Velkk Mask|3929} or {i:Velkk Necklace|Velkk Necklace|3928} to Felmsy for your reward.
** A small camp of Velkks (4 in total) is available in {z:Foret de Hennetiel} (due North-East from) Frontier Bivouac #3 on the southern island with the zone into {z:Sih Gates}.
** A much larger camp (12 or more) of Velkks can be found at {z:Marjami Ravine} if you take the 'Scalable Area' down (requires "Climbing" & "Pair of Velkk gloves" from {q:Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak|Hide and Go Peak} to access) at (K-10) just South-West of Frontier Bivouac #1.

* Questline is repeatable (starting from {q:It Sets My Heart Aflutter|It Sets My Heart Aflutter|It Sets My Heart Aflutter}).
